<description>&lt;p&gt;The Sudanese army has secured Bakori and Sali and repelled attacks in the Blue Nile while advancing in West Kordofan. Pakistan has signed a 1.5 billion military deal to bolster Sudan’s security. The UN reports that Colombian mercenaries backed by the UAE are fighting in Sudan. A former interior minister from the al-Bashir regime has been arrested, and Ahmed Haroun appeared on a podcast, prompting legal commentary. The IOM says 2,500 people have fled villages in North Darfur, and 4,680 battle-related deaths occurred in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxNdjFUeFRoaWdwVmxiMU5SUFR2X09CSDFDSFk0UWVGS3pLRHNKbl9TMEc4VEhMZWZTdk8zREJRYUFmUy0tQUF1bld3cGFjM3kzYW1SQ1Y2T2g4TkpsSW5KMjJ0WUkwS3BiZFJIVXV1U0gyczcwRXZCWTIwTFVNeDB4QXBGY2podXpPbGFHaEJTZm5Ra09mb3I2S0xHcUNEWHdWZTNSTXZVeXZBUXlKNEZ2d2tGd2ZCQ0ct?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian Nigeria News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxNTWF2djZrT293NGk4VU83VkFQRzhrcEc2MHJJTDYwb0YzcHAxVTJLVTZyTDBuS05tX0xwWG1ZaWRHTUdGdzRYSnRwcWx3SE5QbDdTVllSQUw3MjgyOC1KclZaNFBCeFRLUUpJYzdEWXhHaE9ucHlzc20tMnlQejJldGJFUEl6cUNmdmNUM3FGUW8tc2s5VEhaTHFycEgtY1FsUjcwOS1PNXQ1eElhc3M5aE5R?oc=5&quot;&gt;Il Sole 24 ORE&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Modern Ghana&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;MyJoyOnline&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxNVmFBNEtSbjl5MWNiTzk5WkgwNFFCekZYRjByS1lZeUVtQVdmY0I4YXlORU5RUFV5N1FQV2N5LW4tZUZFVXlQcEl3RjNiaVloY3hzVFlwcThHTFBnRWl0WUhNRlpBUVBKUzFIX0RyZXRGMzRLU2ZBcFBlZURFaUdIRDQ1d2xwbGp6M21mQkpyWWxHSlg2WkVMUEVmNUF0N3Y5QmNVRnhVZmdrMnQ4bkhTblFIb25YMUQySHU0WQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Ahram Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Livemint&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;